Subject: [Saphira] Linux 7.3: cpu_feature_enabled() over static_cpu_has() (2.4.4 port)

Saphira-Port-By: Muse Spark 1.3 Contributor for AKADATA LIMITED
(Andrew Smalley, Director)
Note: The API moved; the data must not. Re-derived hunk by hunk
for 2.4.4 and proven by boot, not by inspection.

Ports robn/zfs@844c3a4eb6c1 onto OpenZFS 2.4.4 (HAVE_XSAVES guards here; static_cpu_has_bug probe untouched; 7.3-only recipe so no fallback).

